{"surah": 86, "verses": [{"ayah": 1, "text": "وَٱلسَّمَآءِ وَٱلطَّارِقِ ", "translation": "By the sky and the knocker", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَmَّslٱَw", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "وَٱلطَّارِقِ", "translit": "ِqِrāَّṭlٱَw", "root": "طرق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 2, "text": "وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلطَّارِقُ ", "translation": "And what can make you know what is the knocker?", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَآ", "translit": "ٓāَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "أَدْرَىٰكَ", "translit": "َkٰàَrْdَaʾ", "root": "دري"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَا", "translit": "āَm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلطَّارِقُ", "translit": "ُqِrāَّṭlٱ", "root": "طرق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 3, "text": "ٱلنَّجْمُ ٱلثَّاقِبُ ", "translation": "It is the piercing star[1].", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "ٱلنَّجْمُ", "translit": "ُmْjgَّnlٱ", "root": "نجم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلثَّاقِبُ", "translit": "ُbِqāَّhtlٱ", "root": "ثقب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 4, "text": "إِن كُلُّ نَفْسٍ لَّمَّا عَلَيْهَا حَافِظٌ ", "translation": "There is no soul but that it has over it a protector.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِن", "translit": "nِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كُلُّ", "translit": "ُّlُk", "root": "كلل"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "نَفْسٍ", "translit": "ٍsْfَn", "root": "نفس"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَّمَّا", "translit": "āَّmَّl", "root": ""}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "عَلَيْهَا", "translit": "āَhْyَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "حَافِظٌ", "translit": "ٌẓِfāَḥ", "root": "حفظ"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 5, "text": "فَلْيَنظُرِ ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ مِمَّ خُلِقَ ", "translation": "So let man observe from what he was created.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَلْيَنظُرِ", "translit": "ِrُẓnَyْlَf", "root": "نظر"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْإِنسَٰنُ", "translit": "ُnَٰsnِiʾْlٱ", "root": "انس"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِمَّ", "translit": "َّmِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "خُلِقَ", "translit": "َqِlُhk", "root": "خلق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 6, "text": "خُلِقَ مِن مَّآءٍ دَافِقٍ ", "translation": "He was created from a fluid, ejected,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "خُلِقَ", "translit": "َqِlُhk", "root": "خلق"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مَّآءٍ", "translit": "ٍءٓāَّm", "root": "موه"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "دَافِقٍ", "translit": "ٍqِfāَd", "root": "دفق"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 7, "text": "يَخْرُجُ مِنۢ بَيْنِ ٱلصُّلْبِ وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ ", "translation": "Emerging from between the backbone and the ribs.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَخْرُجُ", "translit": "ُjgُrْhkَy", "root": "خرج"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "مِنۢ", "translit": "ۢnِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بَيْنِ", "translit": "ِnْyَb", "root": "بين"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "ٱلصُّلْبِ", "translit": "ِbْlُّṣlٱ", "root": "صلب"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَٱلتَّرَآئِبِ", "translit": "ِbِyʾٓāَrَّtlٱَw", "root": "ترب"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 8, "text": "إِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ رَجْعِهِۦ لَقَادِرٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, He [i.e., Allāh], to return him [to life], is Able.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "عَلَىٰ", "translit": "ٰàَlَʿع", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "رَجْعِهِۦ", "translit": "ۦِhِʿعْjgَr", "root": "رجع"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "لَقَادِرٌ", "translit": "ٌrِdāَqَl", "root": "قدر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 9, "text": "يَوْمَ تُبْلَى ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ ", "translation": "The Day when secrets will be put on trial,[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "يَوْمَ", "translit": "َmْwَy", "root": "يوم"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "تُبْلَى", "translit": "àَlْbُt", "root": "بلو"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلسَّرَآئِرُ", "translit": "ُrِyʾٓāَrَّslٱ", "root": "سرر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 10, "text": "فَمَا لَهُۥ مِن قُوَّةٍ وَلَا نَاصِرٍ ", "translation": "Then he [i.e., man] will have no power or any helper.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَمَا", "translit": "āَmَf", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَl", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "مِن", "translit": "nِm", "root": ""}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "قُوَّةٍ", "translit": "ٍẗَّwُq", "root": "قوي"}, {"id": 5, "arabic": "وَلَا", "translit": "āَlَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 6, "arabic": "نَاصِرٍ", "translit": "ٍrِṣāَn", "root": "نصر"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 11, "text": "وَٱلسَّمَآءِ ذَاتِ ٱلرَّجْعِ ", "translation": "By the sky which sends back[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلسَّمَآءِ", "translit": "ِءٓāَmَّslٱَw", "root": "سمو"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ذَاتِ", "translit": "ِtāَhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلرَّجْعِ", "translit": "ِʿعْjgَّrlٱ", "root": "رجع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 12, "text": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ ذَاتِ ٱلصَّدْعِ ", "translation": "And [by] the earth which splits,[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَٱلْأَرْضِ", "translit": "ِḍْrَaʾْlٱَw", "root": "ارض"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ذَاتِ", "translit": "ِtāَhd", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "ٱلصَّدْعِ", "translit": "ِʿعْdَّṣlٱ", "root": "صدع"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 13, "text": "إِنَّهُۥ لَقَوْلٌ فَصْلٌ ", "translation": "Indeed, it [i.e., the Qur’ān] is a decisive statement,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّهُۥ", "translit": "ۥُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "لَقَوْلٌ", "translit": "ٌlْwَqَl", "root": "قول"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "فَصْلٌ", "translit": "ٌlْṣَf", "root": "فصل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 14, "text": "وَمَا هُوَ بِٱلْهَزْلِ ", "translation": "And it is not amusement.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَمَا", "translit": "āَmَw", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "هُوَ", "translit": "َwُh", "root": ""}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "بِٱلْهَزْلِ", "translit": "ِlْzَhْlٱِb", "root": "هزل"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 15, "text": "إِنَّهُمْ يَكِيدُونَ كَيْدًا ", "translation": "Indeed, they are planning a plan,", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "إِنَّهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhَّnِiʾ", "root": ""}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "يَكِيدُونَ", "translit": "َnwُdyِkَy", "root": "كيد"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "كَيْدًا", "translit": "āًdْyَk", "root": "كيد"}], "hasIhya": true}, {"ayah": 16, "text": "وَأَكِيدُ كَيْدًا ", "translation": "But I am planning a plan.", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "وَأَكِيدُ", "translit": "ُdyِkَaʾَw", "root": "كيد"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "كَيْدًا", "translit": "āًdْyَk", "root": "كيد"}], "hasIhya": false}, {"ayah": 17, "text": "فَمَهِّلِ ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ أَمْهِلْهُمْ رُوَيْدًۢا ", "translation": "So allow time for the disbelievers. Leave them awhile.[1]", "words": [{"id": 1, "arabic": "فَمَهِّلِ", "translit": "ِlِّhَmَf", "root": "مهل"}, {"id": 2, "arabic": "ٱلْكَٰفِرِينَ", "translit": "َnyِrِfَٰkْlٱ", "root": "كفر"}, {"id": 3, "arabic": "أَمْهِلْهُمْ", "translit": "ْmُhْlِhْmَaʾ", "root": "مهل"}, {"id": 4, "arabic": "رُوَيْدًۢا", "translit": "āًۢdْyَwُr", "root": "رود"}], "hasIhya": false}], "tafsir": {"15": [{"arabic": "وقال عز وجل \"ومكروا ومكر الله والله خير الماكرين\" وقال تعالى \"إنهم يكيدون كيداً وأكيد كيداً فمهل الكافرين أمهلهم رويداً\" فكما لا يجوز للعبد المهمل أن يستدل بإهمال السيد إياه وتمكينه من النعم على حب السيد، بل ينبغي أن يحذر أن يكون ذلك مكراً منه وكيداً مع أن السيد لم يحذره مكر نفسه، فبأن يجب ذلك في حق الله تعالى مع تحذيره استدراجه أولى، فإذن من أمن مكر الله فهو مغتر، ومنشأ هذا الغرور أنه استدل بنعم الدنيا على أنه كريم عند ذلك المنعم، واحتمل أن يكون ذلك دليل الهوان ولكن ذلك الاحتمال لا يوافق الهوى،", "english": "And the Exalted said: \"And they plotted and Allah plotted, and Allah is the best of plotters.\" And He said: \"Indeed, they plan a plan, and I plan a plan. So give the disbelievers respite; give them respite a little.\" So just as it is not permissible for the neglected servant to infer from the master's neglect of him and enabling him with blessings that the master loves him, rather he should be cautious that this might be plotting and scheming from him, even though the master did not warn him of his own plotting, then how much more necessary is this regarding Allah the Exalted with His warning of His gradual entrapment? Therefore, whoever feels secure from Allah's plotting is deluded. The origin of this delusion is that he inferred from worldly blessings that he is honorable with that Bestower, and it is possible that this is evidence of degradation, but that possibility does not agree with the desire (Hawa). So Satan, through the medium of desire (Hawa), inclines the Heart (Qalb) toward what accompanies it, which is believing in its indication of honor, and this is the limit of delusion.", "book_file": "vol3_Vol3-book-10a.doc.txt", "book_title": "Condemnation of Delusion", "content_type": "ethics", "topic": "Al-Ghazali on the diseases of the heart and their cure, from 'Condemnation of Delusion'", "badge": "Ethics"}]}, "wordTiming": {"abdulbasit": {"1": [[1, 350, 2414], [2, 2414, 4129]], "2": [[1, 350, 1525], [2, 1525, 2734], [3, 2734, 3193], [4, 3193, 4495]], "3": [[1, 250, 1709], [2, 1709, 3417]], "4": [[1, 350, 884], [2, 884, 1551], [3, 1551, 2303], [4, 2303, 3710], [5, 3710, 5214], [6, 5214, 6428]], "5": [[1, 350, 2607], [2, 2607, 4684], [3, 4684, 5829], [4, 5829, 6924]], "6": [[1, 350, 1407], [2, 1407, 2048], [3, 2048, 4421], [4, 4421, 5958]], "7": [[1, 350, 1347], [2, 1347, 1780], [3, 1780, 2538], [4, 2538, 3746], [5, 3746, 6349]], "8": [[1, 350, 1352], [2, 1352, 2365], [3, 2365, 3323], [4, 3323, 4599]], "9": [[1, 350, 1122], [2, 1122, 2039], [3, 2039, 4103]], "10": [[1, 350, 1270], [2, 1270, 1756], [3, 1756, 2267], [4, 2267, 3449], [5, 3449, 4497], [6, 4497, 5749]], "11": [[1, 350, 2802], [2, 2802, 3651], [3, 3651, 4913]], "12": [[1, 250, 1331], [2, 1331, 1966], [3, 1966, 2999]], "13": [[1, 350, 1919], [2, 1919, 3540], [3, 3540, 4678]], "14": [[1, 250, 1076], [2, 1076, 1559], [3, 1559, 2607]], "15": [[1, 350, 1681], [2, 1681, 3480], [3, 3480, 4704]], "16": [[1, 250, 1472], [2, 1472, 2477]], "17": [[1, 350, 1311], [2, 1311, 2866], [3, 2866, 4127], [4, 4127, 5514]]}, "husary": {"1": [[1, 350, 3540], [2, 3540, 6190]], "2": [[1, 350, 2214], [2, 2214, 